#, kde-format
msgid "Remote ID:"
msgstr "Udaljeni ID:"

#: editorqml/qml/vpn/l2tp/L2tpIpsec.qml:216
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Optional. How the IPsec server should be identified for authentication. "
"Sometimes referred to as Peer ID or Gateway ID, also referred to as rightid "
"by strongSwan, Libreswan, Openswan and FreeS/WAN. See strongSwan or "
"Libreswan documentation for leftid/rightid syntax and identity parsing."
msgstr ""
"Opciono. Kako se IPsec server identifikuje pri autentifikaciji. Ponekad se "
"naziva ID parnjaka ili ID mrežnog izlaza, a strongSwan, Libreswan, Openswan "
"i FreeS/WAN ga zovu rightid. Sintaksu leftid/rightid i raščlanjivanje "
"identiteta potražite u dokumentaciji strongSwana ili Libreswan."

#: editorqml/qml/vpn/l2tp/L2tpIpsec.qml:225
#, kde-format
msgid "Phase1 Algorithms:"
msgstr "Algoritmi faze 1:"

#: editorqml/qml/vpn/l2tp/L2tpIpsec.qml:228
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Optional. A list of proposals for IKE - Main Mode. The format is “enc-integ-"
"group,enc-integ-group, …”."
msgstr ""
"Opciono. Spisak predloga za IKE – glavni režim. Oblik je „enc-integ-group,"
"enc-integ-group, …“."

#: editorqml/qml/vpn/l2tp/L2tpIpsec.qml:237
#, kde-format
msgid "Phase2 Algorithms:"
msgstr "Algoritmi faze 2:"

#: editorqml/qml/vpn/l2tp/L2tpIpsec.qml:240
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Optional. A list of proposals for ESP - Quick Mode. The format is “enc-integ,"
"enc-integ, …”."
msgstr ""
"Opciono. Spisak predloga za ESP – brzi režim. Oblik je „enc-integ,enc-integ, "
"…“."

#: editorqml/qml/vpn/l2tp/L2tpIpsec.qml:249
#, kde-format
msgid "Phase1 Lifetime:"
msgstr "Trajanje faze 1:"

#: editorqml/qml/vpn/l2tp/L2tpIpsec.qml:251
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"How long the keying channel of a connection should last before being "
"renegotiated."
msgstr ""
"Koliko dugo kanal za ključeve veze treba da traje pre ponovnog pregovaranja."

#: editorqml/qml/vpn/l2tp/L2tpIpsec.qml:269
#, kde-format
msgid "Phase2 Lifetime:"
msgstr "Trajanje faze 2:"

#: editorqml/qml/vpn/l2tp/L2tpIpsec.qml:271
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"How long a particular instance of a connection (a set of encryption/"
"authentication keys for user packets) should last, from successful "
"negotiation to expiry."
msgstr ""
"Koliko dugo određeni primerak veze (skup ključeva za šifrovanje/"
"autentifikaciju korisničkih paketa) treba da traje, od uspešnog pregovaranja "
"do isteka."

#: editorqml/qml/vpn/l2tp/L2tpIpsec.qml:291
#: editorqml/qml/vpn/strongswan/Strongswan.qml:183
#, kde-format
msgid "Enforce UDP encapsulation"
msgstr "Nametni UDP enkapsulaciju"

#: editorqml/qml/vpn/l2tp/L2tpIpsec.qml:293
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Some firewalls block ESP traffic. Enforcing UDP encapsulation even if no NAT "
"situation is detected might help in such cases."
msgstr ""
"Neki zaštitni zidovi blokiraju ESP saobraćaj. Nametanje UDP enkapsulacije "
"čak i kad nije otkriven NAT može da pomogne u takvim slučajevima."

#: editorqml/qml/vpn/l2tp/L2tpIpsec.qml:304
#: editorqml/qml/vpn/strongswan/Strongswan.qml:192
#, kde-format
msgid "Use IP compression"
msgstr "Koristi IP kompresiju"

#: editorqml/qml/vpn/l2tp/L2tpIpsec.qml:306
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"IPComp compresses raw IP packets before they get encrypted. This saves some "
"bandwidth, but uses more processing power."
msgstr ""
"IPComp kompresuje sirove IP pakete pre šifrovanja. Tako se sačuva deo "
"propusnog opsega, ali se troši više procesorske snage."

#: editorqml/qml/vpn/l2tp/L2tpIpsec.qml:317
#, kde-format
msgid "Use IKEv2 key exchange"
msgstr "Koristi razmenu ključeva IKE v2"

#: editorqml/qml/vpn/l2tp/L2tpIpsec.qml:328
#, kde-format
msgid "Disable PFS"
msgstr "Isključi PFS"

#: editorqml/qml/vpn/l2tp/L2tpIpsec.qml:330
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Disable perfect forward secrecy. Do this only if the server doesn’t support "
"PFS."
msgstr ""
"Isključuje savršenu unaprednu tajnost. Uradite ovo samo ako server ne "
"podržava PFS."

